<title>PORTUGAL: Results of BES offer for BIC set for Dec 4.</title>
<headline>Results of BES offer for BIC set for Dec 4.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The special bourse session to decide the results of Banco Espirito Santo's public offer to buy (OPA) for the outstanding shares of its subsidiary Banco Internacional de Credito will be held on December 4, the bourse announced on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BES is offering 2,790 escudos per share for the 6.12 million shares, equal to 52.74 percent of BIC's capital. BES already controls the remainder of the capital.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
